### Success
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-success-001

{"merchantId":"merchant_1","amountMinor":2500,"currency":"INR","paymentMethodToken":"tok_success"}

### Same key + same body -> 200 with Idempotent-Replayed: true, same payment id
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-success-001

{"merchantId":"merchant_1","amountMinor":2500,"currency":"INR","paymentMethodToken":"tok_success"}

### Same key + different body -> 422
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-success-001

{"merchantId":"merchant_1","amountMinor":9999,"currency":"INR","paymentMethodToken":"tok_success"}

### Transient failure then success (2 attempts)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-flaky-001

{"merchantId":"merchant_1","amountMinor":1200,"currency":"USD","paymentMethodToken":"tok_flaky_once"}

### Retries exhausted -> FAILED / RETRIES_EXHAUSTED (3 attempts)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-timeout-001

{"merchantId":"merchant_1","amountMinor":1200,"currency":"USD","paymentMethodToken":"tok_timeout"}

### Permanent decline -> DECLINED (1 attempt, no retry)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-decline-001

{"merchantId":"merchant_1","amountMinor":800,"currency":"EUR","paymentMethodToken":"tok_decline"}

### Invalid: card-number-like token is rejected -> 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: demo-invalid-001

{"merchantId":"merchant_1","amountMinor":800,"currency":"EUR","paymentMethodToken":"4111111111111111"}

### Retrieve (replace the id)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}

### Attempt history (replace the id)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/payments/{{paymentId}}/attempts

### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health
